    "/user/content/{id}/access-token": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Request a playback link",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "Mints a temporary, device-bound link for the video or audio file.\n\nCall this immediately before playback and hand the returned token to the player as `GET /api/media/{token}?device_uuid=...`. The link is bound to `device_uuid`: copied to another device it returns 403 and is recorded as a device conflict. It is reusable until it expires (default 3 days, configurable) so pausing and resuming works. \n\nA locked lesson is refused here too, and the refusal is written to the security-event log. This is the gate that makes sequential access a rule rather than a client-side convention: without a token there is no playable URL for any client to fetch.\n\n### Path parameters\n\n- `id` — *integer*, required. Lesson id. Must be a video or audio lesson.\n\n### Body fields\n\n- `device_uuid` — *string*, **required**. Must match the device_uuid used at login, or the link will not work.\n\n### Captured into the environment\n\n- `{{media_token}}` ← `data.token`\n\n### File or YouTube\n\nCheck `source` before playing:\n\n- `file` — play `/api/media/{token}?device_uuid=...` as before.\n- `youtube` — play `youtube_url` in the YouTube player.\n\n```json\n{\"token\": \"R0eUO9kp...\", \"expires_at\": \"2026-09-17T00:22:57+00:00\", \"source\": \"youtube\", \"youtube_url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7JevotOZqQU\"}\n```\n\nProgress is reported the same way for both.",
        "tags": [
          "Student/Content/Playback"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "example": "",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Accept",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "example": "application/json",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "example": "application/json",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Accept-Language",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "",
            "required": true,
            "example": "{{locale}}",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "device_uuid": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "device_uuid"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "device_uuid": "9f2b4c7a-15de-4e83-b6c1-3ad0e9f47c52"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "status_code": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "token": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "expires_at": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "source": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "file",
                            "youtube"
                          ],
                          "description": "Where the lesson plays from.\nfile: play /api/media/{token}?device_uuid=... in the normal player.\nyoutube: play youtube_url in the YouTube player."
                        },
                        "youtube_url": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "The YouTube link when source is youtube. null when source is file.",
                          "nullable": true
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "token",
                        "expires_at",
                        "source",
                        "youtube_url"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "message",
                    "status_code",
                    "data"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "message": "Access link generated successfully",
                  "status_code": 1,
                  "data": {
                    "token": "DyUJdA6F8hSaHHvymNwOZ5R0YCbjOQUZ...",
                    "expires_at": "2026-08-13T09:36:15+00:00",
                    "source": "file",
                    "youtube_url": null
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          },
          "401": {
